        ],
        "content": "Perfect! A **Harry Potter LitRPG** — so we’ll blend the magical world of Hogwarts with game-like mechanics (experience points, stats, and leveling). Since the Harry Potter world itself is copyrighted, we won’t reproduce actual storylines or text. Instead, I’ll create a **parallel wizarding academy** in the same *style* of whimsical British magic but with original names, places, and characters. Think: “magical boarding school with rules of magic + RPG mechanics.”  \n\nQuick clarifier before we jump in: do you want to take the role of a student (and I’ll DM as the “game world”), or would you prefer I create a protagonist and narrate their adventure LitRPG-style with stats evolving along the way?",
